# ── Client build-time configuration (Vite) ──────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the Workers backend (no trailing slash).
# The client derives the WebSocket URL from this (http -> ws, https -> wss).
#
#   Local dev (wrangler dev):  http://127.0.0.1:8787
#   Production:                https://echoes-of-the-veil.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local overrides. If unset, the client falls
# back to http://127.0.0.1:8787 in dev and same-origin in production builds.
VITE_WORKER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# ── Deployment secrets (NOT read from this file) ────────────────────────────
# These must be configured as GitHub Actions repository secrets for the
# auto-deploy workflow in .github/workflows/deploy.yml:
#
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN   - API token with "Workers Scripts: Edit" and
#                            "Cloudflare Pages: Edit" permissions.
#   CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID  - Your Cloudflare account ID (dashboard sidebar).
#
# See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md for step-by-step setup.
